"DGFiP, an OGA or an expert accountant.\n"
"\n"
"It adds a new button \"EDI VAT\" on the French vat report and a new menu "
"item \"EDI exports\" (below \"Reporting\",\n"
"in the \"Statement Reports\" section).\n"
